WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.079 --> 00:00:02.450
(upbeat music)

2
00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:06.870
Upcycling is the latest environmentally friendly trend

3
00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:10.450
currently taking over the fashion world.

4
00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:13.130
What is upcycling you ask?

5
00:00:13.130 --> 00:00:14.650
I have the same questions,

6
00:00:14.650 --> 00:00:18.610
and to find out we've teamed up with our friends at LG

7
00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:23.080
who know a thing or two about clothing care.

8
00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:25.430 line:15%
Hi Nicole I'm so excited to meet you.

9
00:00:25.430 --> 00:00:28.250 line:15%
I'm kind of star struck, I'm not kidding.

10
00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:30.440 line:15%
I am one of your biggest fans.

11
00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:31.980
First of all, I think if you look up

12
00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:34.040
the definition of cool in the dictionary,

13
00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:35.720
your picture is probably there.

14
00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:36.660
Oh my gosh.

15
00:00:37.573 --> 00:00:39.950
What to you is upcycling?

16
00:00:39.950 --> 00:00:41.910 line:15%
Upcycling is taking materials

17
00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:44.150 line:15%
and things that already exist in our world today

18
00:00:44.150 --> 00:00:45.930
and creating it into something new

19
00:00:45.930 --> 00:00:48.370
to maximize it and give it longevity.

20
00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:51.220
Upcycling can be taking a garment

21
00:00:51.220 --> 00:00:53.870
and totally reinventing it.

22
00:00:53.870 --> 00:00:56.490
And today you're going to take this sweatshirt

23
00:00:56.490 --> 00:00:57.810
and make it into a bag?

24
00:00:57.810 --> 00:01:00.360
Yes, to keep it from going into landfills,

25
00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:02.560
we have to find creative solutions for it.

26
00:01:02.560 --> 00:01:05.300
LG is creating awareness of how to care for clothes

27
00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:07.750 line:15%
because they're giving us the opportunity to wash things

28
00:01:07.750 --> 00:01:09.270 line:15%
and take care of our clothing

29
00:01:09.270 --> 00:01:11.360 line:15%
so it'll create another life for them.

30
00:01:11.360 --> 00:01:13.200 line:15%
I'm obsessed with the LG WashTower

31
00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:15.960 line:15%
and LG Styler Steam Closet in our dressing room.

32
00:01:15.960 --> 00:01:17.650
And I actually used the WashTower

33
00:01:17.650 --> 00:01:20.310
to clean this sweatshirt that Nicole and I will upcycle

34
00:01:20.310 --> 00:01:22.050
into something great for the summer.

35
00:01:22.050 --> 00:01:24.180
We're going to crop the sleeves off of it

36
00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:25.800
and take the excess,

37
00:01:25.800 --> 00:01:28.663
and turn that into a little matching bag.

38
00:01:28.663 --> 00:01:31.330 line:15%
(upbeat music)

39
00:01:59.550 --> 00:02:02.060
Now we have our summer bag.

40
00:02:02.060 --> 00:02:04.130
It's so cute it like hurts.

41
00:02:04.130 --> 00:02:07.220
I love that you chose like that adorable mint green.

42
00:02:07.220 --> 00:02:09.340
To learn more about how you can give

43
00:02:09.340 --> 00:02:11.340 line:15%
a second life to your clothes

44
00:02:11.340 --> 00:02:13.100 line:15%
and get some clothing care tips

45
00:02:13.100 --> 00:02:16.870 line:15%
check out LGsecondlife.com.

46
00:02:16.870 --> 00:02:18.351
Thank you.

47
00:02:18.351 --> 00:02:20.934 line:15%
(upbeat music)

